{
  "metadata": {
    "name": "A1 \u00b7 MotorEPM on measured proprioception \u00b7 v2 identity",
    "description": "BYTE-IDENTITY GATE config: identical to its MotorEPM source except the module type is MotorEPMv2 (and, for the guarded variant, state_prior params present with gain 0). v2 with every feature at 0 must reproduce v1 EXACTLY (motor_epm_v2_plan \u00a71); any divergence is a v2 bug, never a finding.",
